    "title": "Bidora Countries and Operational Policies",
    "version": "0.1.0-draft",
    "description": "Managed global regional/feature/maintenance policy and restricted development request metadata. Implementation and live verification are separate; no legal production retention decision or destructive cleanup is activated."
  },
