      "put": {
        "operationId": "updatePlatformOperationalPolicy",
        "description": "Current manage capability/recent TOTP, optimistic version and actor-scoped idempotency. State/history/receipt/audit/outbox are atomic. No existing organization/price/tax rewrite. Effective Owner and maintenance manage required. UTC maintenance and feature checks affect subsequent tenant business calls; authentication/recovery/admin access remain. No deletion, production metadata collection, legal holds or mandatory-security toggles.",
